content.text:
Fixed. `TokenContent` now selects the header component by viewport too:

```tsx
const Header = isMobile ? DrawerHeader : DialogHeader;
const Title = isMobile ? DrawerTitle : DialogTitle;
```

So the mobile branch renders `DrawerHeader`/`DrawerTitle` inside the `Drawer`, and desktop renders `DialogHeader`/`DialogTitle` inside the `Dialog` — no more cross-primitive mixing. I also aligned the waiting/recall title to `text-base` so both title variants match. Compiles clean.

